{"parentUuid": null, "isSidechain": true, "promptId": "89daae11-03b7-48a9-8a56-4740cd2ec122", "agentId": "a1c0594bdb2077365", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "Run a web interface guidelines audit on new/modified frontend files in StudyEngine. Check for accessibility, semantic HTML, keyboard support, form behavior, focus management, and HTMX patterns.\n\n## Files to audit\n1. `/Users/test/Projects/studyengine/app/templates/quiz/loading.html`\n2. `/Users/test/Projects/studyengine/app/templates/units/partials/extraction_status.html`\n\nAlso check these for context:\n3. `/Users/test/Projects/studyengine/app/routes/jobs.py` \u2014 what the status endpoints return\n4. `/Users/test/Projects/studyengine/app/templates/base.html` \u2014 base template structure (first 80 lines)\n\n## Checklist to evaluate\n**Accessibility:**\n- [ ] Are loading/polling states announced to screen readers (aria-live, role=\"status\")?\n- [ ] Are error states communicated accessibly?\n- [ ] Do interactive elements have accessible labels?\n\n**Semantic HTML:**\n- [ ] Are heading levels correct?\n- [ ] Is the loading state expressed with appropriate HTML elements?\n\n**HTMX patterns:**\n- [ ] Is polling stopped when the job completes (not polling forever)?\n- [ ] Does HTMX redirect work correctly (HX-Redirect header)?\n- [ ] Are there any infinite polling loops if the job never completes?\n\n**Mobile/responsive:**\n- [ ] Is text readable at mobile sizes?\n- [ ] Are touch targets adequate?\n\nRead the files directly and produce a checklist-style report with pass/fail for each item."}, "uuid": "5752afbf-a30d-4c6d-aada-0e93de963459", "timestamp": "2026-04-25T20:30:39.878Z", "userType": "external", "entrypoint": "cli", "cwd": "/Users/test/Projects/studyengine", "sessionId": "3f5802ab-0587-4c78-8a7e-80ca419e724f", "version": "2.1.117", "gitBranch": "test-branch", "slug": "hazy-honking-kernighan"}
